diff --git a/.commit-msg b/.commit-msg
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..81f93e2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.commit-msg
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+Add threshold support to frai eval for CI/CD gating
+
+- Add --threshold option to frai eval CLI (e.g. --threshold exact_match=0.9)
+- Thresholds can be used multiple times for different metrics
+- Exit code 1 if any threshold fails, 0 if all pass, 2 for validation errors
+- Threshold passes when metric score >= minimum, fails if metric has no score
+- JSON reports gain top-level passed boolean and thresholds array
+- Markdown reports gain a Thresholds section with PASS/FAIL status
+- generateReport in frai-core accepts optional thresholds object
+- Tests verify threshold logic and edge cases
+
+Valid metric IDs: exact_match, toxicity, length_variance
+Threshold values must be between 0 and 1.
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
